Package: owdata
Title: Index of openwashdata R Data Packages
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lars", "Schöbitz", , "lschoebitz@ethz.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2196-5015")),
    person("Global Health Engineering, ETH Zurich", role = "cph")
  )
Description: Index metapackage for the openwashdata R data packages. Ships
    a harvested catalog of every package in the openwashdata GitHub
    organisation, with its datasets and variables, as internal data behind
    accessor and search functions, and installs any listed package from
    the openwashdata R-universe. The catalog is refreshed by a weekly
    harvest.
